## Venue

The conference takes place at the
**[Leipzig University of Applied Sciences](https://www.htwk-leipzig.de/en/htwk-leipzig), Leipzig, Germany <br/>**
(Hochschule für Technik, Wirtschaft und Kultur Leipzig, HTWK)

### Address

Karl-Liebknecht-Straße 134 <br/>
04277 Leipzig <br/>
Germany

